PARSFILE
#FullDataName Road: 3D Surface (All Properties)`River Bed`Off-Road
*IMAGE_TYPE PASTED
*IMAGE_PASTED Roads\3D_Road\Road_986e17e2-fa3a-4687-b222-d202e999e960.png
